<title>USA: Henry Schein acquires Health-Tech Systems.</title>
<headline>Henry Schein acquires Health-Tech Systems.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Henry Schein Inc said Monday that it has acquired Health-Tech Systems Inc, a provider of dental practice management software.</p>
<p>In a press release, Schein said it expects to take a non-recurring charge related to the transaction in 1997.</p>
<p>A company spokesman was not available to elaborate.</p>
<p>The company said that it expects the acquisition of Health-Tec, which had sales of $4.0 million in 1996, to be accretive to earnings in 1997.</p>
